[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5340.87, "timestamp": "01:29:00", "text": "所以，通常情况下，你只需要把它打开就行了。 大概"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5345.51, "timestamp": "01:29:05", "text": "过了30秒左右才"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5347.59, "timestamp": "01:29:07", "text": "开机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5351.75, "timestamp": "01:29:11", "text": "然后冷却 10 秒才能真正"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.79, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "进行提取。 但如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5358.629, "timestamp": "01:29:18", "text": "两"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.03, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "分钟甚至更长时间（可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5362.709, "timestamp": "01:29:22", "text": "超过两分钟）不进行萃取，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5364.149, "timestamp": "01:29:24", "text": "它可能会自行关闭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5367.11, "timestamp": "01:29:27", "text": "。 我猜也是这样。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5370.07, "timestamp": "01:29:30", "text": "其实很少遇到这种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5371.11, "timestamp": "01:29:31", "text": "情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5374.229, "timestamp": "01:29:34", "text": "哦，等等，生物研究方面的东西都没了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5376.39, "timestamp": "01:29:36", "text": "Xville 提取点已经消失了。 是的。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5377.99, "timestamp": "01:29:37", "text": "。 是的。 之前有人已经拿走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5380.39, "timestamp": "01:29:40", "text": "。 你之前看到天空中的光了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5381.03, "timestamp": "01:29:41", "text": "吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.11, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "所以他们只能带走一个人，而且只能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5386.55, "timestamp": "01:29:46", "text": "带走一次。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5389.11, "timestamp": "01:29:49", "text": "。 如果他们把它叫出来然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5391.99, "timestamp": "01:29:51", "text": "提取出来，它就会消失。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5395.91, "timestamp": "01:29:55", "text": "呃，所以没有永久的方案。"}]